## 0.2 Telegraph format (memory-bank) — NOT for plan/gap

Applies to implement/task/qa/reflect shards, etc.

- Bullets > paragraphs. One line = one fact.
- Abbrev: req impl cfg auth val err msg fn comp dep AC PRD ERD
- Max 3 sentences/section unless technical detail requires more
- No filler, no intros

**Does NOT apply** to `plan-*.md` / `gap-*.md` / `architecture/**` / `decompose-*/**` (§0.0). Using telegraph on those files = violation.

## 0.3 Context window — load only role input

| Role | Reads | Does NOT read |
|------|-------|---------------|
| PM | user chat, `pm/*` | full ARCHITECTURE, all code |
| BACK/FRONT/INTEG dev | `activeContext.md` **`load_now`**: work shard + `decompose-*/index.yaml`; AC = work shard | **full `plan-*.md`**, `index.md` coverage, `tasks.md`/`systemPatterns` as load, all shards, `done` section |
| TL | `tl/*`, `activeContext.md`, delivery refs | full design docs |
| Reviewer (BACK QA) | qa/bugfix shard + changed files; plan **§N** only if AC unclear | full `plan-*.md`, full memory-bank |
| Architect (BACK PLAN) | `DECISION_LOG` / plan refs + stage summary | unrelated task shards |
| **INTEG PLAN** | as required by `workflow-plan.mdc` (portal inventory, all relevant implement) | infra-only implement; gap/contracts not required |

Workflow router (`mainrule.mdc`) + isolation rules enforce this per command. Lean load **input** ≠ short plan **output**.

## 0.4 Reference by ID — never repeat

- Every entity: `T-xxx`, `US-xxx`, `BUG-xxx`, `SCR-xxx`, legacy `[VAN-20260529]` kept as alias
- Cross-ref by ID + link — do not copy-paste descriptions
- Canonical detail: one shard in `memory-bank/<category>/<id>.md` or role artifact path
- Exception under §0.0: plan may **expand** as-built detail needed for wire; still prefer links to implement IDs when already documented

## 0.5 Document size limits (**WRITE only**)

Applies when **создаёшь/правишь** non-plan artifacts. **Does NOT** limit `read` / `skill` tool output.

- Max **200 lines** per **written** non-plan doc. Split → subfiles; root = index + links.
- **`plan-*.md` / `gap-*.md` / PLAN GAP plans / `architecture/**` / `decompose-*/**`: NO max lines** — must be maximally detailed (§0.0). DECOMPOSE shards: no code bodies, but full coverage/delta/checkpoints.
- `memory-bank/tasks.md` = **index** (активные + progress); хронология → `tasks/log/` (**пишет `finalize-step` на sNN**; руками — только смена фазы эпика)
- Task detail → `memory-bank/<category>/<id>.md` (e.g. `back/implement/T-020-slug.md`)
- Large **non-plan** docs split into shard dirs (see `memory-bank-paths.mdc`):
  - `domain/SP-*.md` ← `systemPatterns.md`
  - `back/creative/shards/` (ERD/TG)
- **FORBIDDEN:** трактовать «200 lines» как `limit` на Read `SKILL.md` / workflow / code.

## 0.5.1 Doc router (mandatory)

**FORBIDDEN:** read full index target as monolith — indexes are tables only.

**REQUIRED session load order (default IMPLEMENT/TASK/BUGFIX/QA):**

1. `memory-bank/activeContext.md` → **`load_now`** list (ONLY those files)
2. **IMPLEMENT (эпик):** work shard `decompose-*/sNN|eNN-*.yaml` + `decompose-*/index.yaml`
3. **Прочие режимы:** ONE work shard (`task` / `bugfix` / `qa`) из `load_now`
4. AC source = **work shard** (цель / файлы / TDD / Fix plan). **Не** подставлять полный `plan-*.md` или index «как AC»
5. Если в step `Consumes: plan §N` и AC в shard не хватает — **jump только на §N** (Read/offset), не весь plan
6. `load_if_needed` only when task requires
7. **NEVER** load `done — do NOT load` section files

**`load_now` FORBIDDEN (IMPLEMENT / QA / BUGFIX / TASK / REFLECT):** полный `memory-bank/**/plan-*.md` · «acceptance context = весь plan» · creative monolith без open CR · `tasks.md` / `systemPatterns.md` · `decompose-*/index.md` · `implement-*/index.md`

**`load_now` OK index:** `plan/decompose-*/index.yaml` (status). `index.md` — DECOMPOSE/AUDIT coverage, не IMPLEMENT hot path.

**`load_now` OK для полного plan:** только когда следующий режим **PLAN** или **DECOMPOSE** и plan — объект работы.

**PLAN override:** follow that mode's `workflow-*-plan.mdc` inventory (may require many implement files + code grep). Doc-router lean defaults yield to workflow PLAN steps + §0.0.

**Index files** (load table, then ONE shard link):

| Index | Shards |
|-------|--------|
| `systemPatterns.md` | `domain/SP-*.md` |
| `back/creative/creative-booking-erd.md` | `back/creative/shards/ERD-*.md` |
| `back/creative/creative-telegram-*.md` | `back/creative/shards/TG-*.md` |
| `plan/decompose-*/index.yaml` | status queue (`load_now` IMPLEMENT) |
| `plan/decompose-*/index.md` | coverage tables (DECOMPOSE/AUDIT only) |

Канон «где стоим»: `activeContext.md` (§Handoff + load_now) + `decompose-*/index.yaml` (прогресс). `tasks.md` — индекс эпиков. **Нет** `memory-bank/focus/`.

## 0.6 Chunked execution

- Dev: ONE task shard at a time → review → next
- Reviewer: ONE batch (max 4 related tasks, same domain, no mutual deps)
- Do NOT load full task history when working one task
- **PLAN:** write full plan artifact in one session; do not artificially split plan into «short chapters» to save tokens

## 0.7 Handoff summary

When passing work between roles: 2–3 lines + file path. Not "read everything".

**activeContext ONE Handoff (HARD):** ровно один блок `## Handoff …` + ≤ один `## done` — на FINISH **Write весь файл** (не sandwich). Append/стопка = FAIL/halt. История → `tasks/log/` + role artifacts. Detail: `finish-block.mdc` / `finish-doc-router.mdc`.

## 0.8 Code comments

Minimal. WHY only, not WHAT. Max 1 line. No comments unless non-obvious.

## 0.9 Approval gate — `implement this`

**Requires exact phrase `implement this`** (no typos, no translations):

- file create/edit/delete
- git commit/push/branch ops
- deploy, db push, secrets, docker compose up that mutates state
- autonomous multi-file batches outside explicit role command
- **any** Write/Delete under `.cursor/rules/**` — **including during `* IMPLEMENT`** unless current implement shard lists that exact path in `files:`

**Does NOT require gate:**

- role commands (`BACK IMPLEMENT`, `PM PLAN`, …) — user intent via command **only for prod code paths within §0.9.1 allowlist**
- read-only: grep, read files, curl GET, diagnostics
- analysis + change plan before approval

Before requesting approval: list files, changes, commands, consequences.

## 0.9.1 IMPLEMENT scope lock (HARD)

Full canon: @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-implement-scope-lock.mdc

**Why:** `* IMPLEMENT` bypassed §0.9 → agents edited whole epics, `.cursor/rules/**`, deleted tests, auto-closed QA/AUDIT (T-HUB-040 class incident).

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Session | one `epic_id` + one `step_id` from `activeContext` / `load_now` work shard |
| Allowlist | work shard `files:` · `context.produces.files` · current `implement-*/sNN.yaml` · tests added to shard `files:` before FINISH |
| Rules edit | shard `files:` must list each `.cursor/rules/...` path **or** user `implement this` with path list; plan «update workflow rules» ≠ permission |
| FINISH rules purge | replace FINISH prose with `mb-finish` call only — **FORBIDDEN** remove gates, Phase 0, coverage rubric, behavior-first, non-FINISH steps |
| Tests/docs | **FORBIDDEN** delete/shrink tests, validators, README without shard `deletes:` |
| Index | **FORBIDDEN** mark other steps `completed`; only `finalize-step` for current step |
| Modes | **FORBIDDEN** run QA/AUDIT/REFLECT/EPIC_DONE without separate user role command |
| Pre-FINISH | enumerate changed paths; out-of-scope → REVERT before Handoff |

Loop sessions: same lock; no «finish whole epic» without per-step user continuation.

## 0.10 Session start

Triggers: `continue project <name>` · role command (`BACK IMPLEMENT`, …) · `PM INIT`

On start: (1) read `memory-bank/activeContext.md`; (2) load ONLY current role docs (§0.3) unless PLAN workflow expands inventory; (3) continue from current stage — do NOT re-execute completed stages.

**On FINISH** (end of IMPLEMENT, QA pass, PLAN, VAN, REFLECT, ARCHIVE NOW, TASK, BUGFIX): run @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-doc-router.mdc — update `activeContext.md` (+ `tasks.md` index as needed).

## 0.11 Integration verification (connection rule)

For every external ref in code — grep project for counterpart. Missing counterpart = **bug**.

| Type | Rule |
|------|------|
| Storage key | every `.get(key)` ↔ `.set(key)` consumer |
| Events | every listener ↔ dispatcher |
| DB | column in code ↔ migration |
| ENV | every env var in code ↔ `.env` / settings |
| API route | endpoint ↔ client/test caller |

Mandatory in **BACK IMPLEMENT** (before finish) and **BACK QA**.

## 0.12 Execution discipline

- Collect ALL edits per file → one Write/Edit pass
- Read file once per session; plan edits from that read
- **Subagents:** **обязательные gate’ы** — codebase search → `explorer`; pre-FINISH `verify` (`code_changed`); BACK QA `reviewer` — `.claude/instructions/spawn-hard.md`. Прочие Agent — свободно. Frontend-тесты only parent: `.cursor/rules/front-tests-parent-only.mdc` / `~/.claude/rules/02-front-tests-parent-only.md`.
- `tasks.md` updates: только смена фазы эпика (или `finalize-step`); checkbox-only на shards
- **PLAN:** prefer one comprehensive Write of `plan-*.md`; size is not a reason to truncate

