## 0.15 Session & chat economy

Detail: @.cursor/rules/shared/context-session-economy.mdc

- **One chat = one atomic subtask** (not whole epic); new chat on role switch or subtask done
- **FINISH:** **перезаписать** единственный `## Handoff` в `activeContext.md` (не append) → doc-router → recommend new chat (@.cursor/templates/finish-doc-router.md + @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-doc-router.mdc)
- **Session start:** `load_now` + handoff file; never depend on prior chat transcript
- **Skills:** lazy — only skills for current subtask
- **QA:** qa/bugfix shard + diff + §0.11 grep; skip `plan-*.md`; if AC unclear → only `plan §N`, never full plan in `load_now`
- **PLAN / DECOMPOSE / architecture exception:** §0.0 — do not shorten plan, `decompose-*/**`, or `architecture/**` artifacts to satisfy this section
